menu "Live Translator"

config TRANSLATOR_DEV_STAY_ON
    bool "Dev: keep the screen on and never deep sleep"
    default n
    help
        For development at the desk: the 30 s screen-off timer and the deep-sleep rule are skipped, even on
        battery. Locking (PWR x1) and the double-tap screen toggle still work. Leave it off for real use: the
        AMOLED and the radio drain the battery in hours.

endmenu
